flowchart LR
  Key[Seed and versions<br/>Streams and boundaries]
  subgraph Candidate[Candidates 0 through 7]
    direction TB
    Route[Build baseline route<br/>Validate movement]
    Hazards[If baseline passes:<br/>place boosts and hazards<br/>revalidate route]
    Check{Both pass?}
    Accept[Accept candidate]
    Reject[Reject candidate]
    Route --> Hazards --> Check
    Check -->|yes| Accept
    Check -->|no| Reject
    Reject -->|next candidate| Route
  end
  subgraph Fallback[Fallback validation]
    direction TB
    Fixed[Stationary safe connector<br/>No hazards or required boosts]
    Safe{Valid?}
    Valid[Accept fallback]
    Error[Build error<br/>Suspend at frontier]
    Fixed --> Safe
    Safe -->|yes| Valid
    Safe -->|no| Error
  end
  Ready[Validated section<br/>Voxel build next]
  Key --> Candidate
  Candidate -->|accepted| Ready
  Candidate -->|eight failures| Fallback
  Fallback -->|accepted| Ready
